-----

THIS MOD IS NOT A VIRUS!

This mod does NOT inflict ANY damage to your hardware or any software. It utilizes windows on your desktop to
create "meta-horror", but does not modify any system files nor modify any user files. It also does not send any
user data to any external servers whatsoever. Thank you.

spectrum_11 may open system shells or similar apps, and will use them to inflict a scare, but will not do any
permanent damage. The Broken Script (the main mod) does NOT do this, and spectrum_11 can only be obtained from
the official Discord server, after solving several puzzles.

